  "Emitimos fatura (ou fatura-recibo) dos serviços, nos termos da lei. Se a quiser com NIF, diga-o no atendimento.": "We issue an invoice (or invoice-receipt) for the services, as required by law. If you want it with your tax ID, say so at the appointment.",
